# cargo-fuzz build + runtime artifacts (never committed).
/target
# libFuzzer crash/leak/timeout artifacts land here at run time; any genuine
# finding is MINIMISED and promoted into the committed `crash-regressions/`
# dir (wired into `cargo test`), so this raw dir stays ignored.
/artifacts
# `cargo fuzz coverage` output.
/coverage
# Ephemeral writable corpus used for fuzz runs so libFuzzer's coverage-
# increasing discoveries never mutate the committed, byte-reproducible seed
# corpus under `corpus/` (which `generate_seed_corpus.py --check` guards).
/corpus-work
